254
00:14:23,820 --> 00:14:26,540
He annihilated my strongest card.

255
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:29,440
It's all over for you, Tweed.

256
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:31,280
Don't give up.

257
00:14:31,640 --> 00:14:33,240
I'm all out of moves.

258
00:14:34,040 --> 00:14:37,317
The only monster card that I've
got left is Battle Warrior.

259
00:14:37,400 --> 00:14:39,660
And his attack powers are way too low.

260
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:42,540
Well, are you going to play or surrender?

261
00:14:43,100 --> 00:14:46,397
Yugi, isn't there some way Joey
can beat that little ghoul?

262
00:14:46,480 --> 00:14:48,060
He's in a big jam, Taya.

263
00:14:48,540 --> 00:14:51,246
Attacking the zombie
army doesn't do any good.

264
00:14:51,400 --> 00:14:54,260
And that trap card
blocks all his defenses.

265
00:14:55,600 --> 00:14:56,430
Defense!

266
00:14:56,513 --> 00:14:57,343
That's it!

267
00:14:57,426 --> 00:14:58,480
Joey, there is a way!

268
00:14:58,740 --> 00:15:02,257
You've got a magic card in your deck
that can turn this whole thing around!

269
00:15:02,340 --> 00:15:03,640
Huh? Huh?

270
00:15:04,460 --> 00:15:06,060
You've gotta be kidding.

271
00:15:06,500 --> 00:15:07,618
You're Yugi, right?

272
00:15:07,780 --> 00:15:12,133
Well, maybe you beat Kaiba, but the
strategy I gave Bones is just perfect.

273
00:15:12,260 --> 00:15:14,000
Your friend is a goner.

274
00:15:14,760 --> 00:15:15,760
Joey, he's wrong!

275
00:15:16,380 --> 00:15:17,280
You sure?

276
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:22,117
Okay, yeah.

277
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:23,600
Trust in the cards.

278
00:15:24,140 --> 00:15:26,120
Yeah, this is... the one!

279
00:15:26,500 --> 00:15:28,637
This must be the card
Yugi was talking about.

280
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:32,097
Shield and Sword is a magic
card that swaps the attack

281
00:15:32,180 --> 00:15:34,857
and defense points of
every monster on the field.

282
00:15:34,940 --> 00:15:38,737
If I can take away the zombie's attack
power by flipping it to defense,

283
00:15:38,820 --> 00:15:41,497
his monsters won't be
able to stop my next card.

284
00:15:41,580 --> 00:15:43,051
Yep, it's my only chance.

285
00:15:44,140 --> 00:15:45,964
Battle Warrior, in attack mode!

286
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:50,440
So it's the only move you had left, huh?

287
00:15:50,560 --> 00:15:54,937
And then I add this magic card
called Shield and Sword. What?

288
00:15:55,020 --> 00:15:56,120
Go!

289
00:15:56,560 --> 00:15:58,240
Offensive, defensive, flip!

290
00:16:04,040 --> 00:16:06,397
Zombie monsters have no will of their own.

291
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:08,517
They can't defend themselves on this turn.

292
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:09,430
We're sunk.

293
00:16:11,700 --> 00:16:14,347
My zombie's attack power
has dropped to zero!

294
00:16:14,660 --> 00:16:18,217
And my battle warrior's attack and
defense points switched too, see?

295
00:16:18,300 --> 00:16:20,040
Smash those zombie freaks!

296
00:16:20,380 --> 00:16:22,020
Ultimate Battlefest!

297
00:16:25,560 --> 00:16:29,197
With their attack points at zero,
the zombies can't come back to life.

298
00:16:29,280 --> 00:16:31,200
How could I lose?

299
00:16:31,520 --> 00:16:32,620
All right!

300
00:16:33,040 --> 00:16:33,980
Joey, you won!

301
00:16:34,100 --> 00:16:35,100
You did it, Joey!

302
00:16:35,540 --> 00:16:36,980
I did, didn't I?

303
00:16:37,500 --> 00:16:38,330
Mm-hmm.

304
00:16:39,980 --> 00:16:42,640
See you around, loser. Oh, wait, boss!

305
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:45,420
Hmm? Wait up, boss! Hey, boss!

306
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:46,790
Bandit Key,

307
00:16:47,160 --> 00:16:49,937
maybe next time you'll have
the nerve to duel me face

308
00:16:50,020 --> 00:16:53,255
-to-face instead of hiding
behind your creepy flunkies.

309
00:16:53,740 --> 00:16:55,460
Duel you face to face?

310
00:16:55,660 --> 00:16:57,013
You're hopeless, dweeb.

311
00:16:57,420 --> 00:17:01,697
The game of duel monsters is all about
keeping your opponents off balance.

312
00:17:01,780 --> 00:17:05,600
Winning the duel's all that
matters, not how you go about it.

313
00:17:06,120 --> 00:17:08,473
We'll just see about that, bandit Keith.

314
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:10,840
Yeah, right.

315
00:17:11,060 --> 00:17:13,236
I'm quivering in fear already, dweeb.

316
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:18,320
What a jerk.

317
00:17:18,940 --> 00:17:20,617
Guys, look, I'm really sorry.

318
00:17:20,700 --> 00:17:23,240
I didn't mean to drag
Ollie into this mess.

319
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:26,617
Next time, don't be in such a
big hurry to run off on your own.

320
00:17:26,700 --> 00:17:27,697
Hey, it's all right.

321
00:17:27,780 --> 00:17:30,133
We know that it wasn't your fault, Joey.

322
00:17:30,260 --> 00:17:33,637
Yeah, I mean, as long as he won
the duel, we can forgive him.

323
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:35,838
I admit you had us worried at first.

324
00:17:35,940 --> 00:17:37,837
But you really came through this time.

325
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:39,297
I got lucky, that's all.

326
00:17:39,380 --> 00:17:41,080
It wasn't luck, Joey. Huh?

327
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:43,217
It was your determination,

328
00:17:43,300 --> 00:17:46,437
your trust in the cards, and the
promise you made to your sister.

329
00:17:46,520 --> 00:17:48,108
That's what helped you win.

330
00:17:50,700 --> 00:17:52,740
I only need two more star chips.

331
00:17:53,100 --> 00:17:54,512
Hang in there, Serenity.

332
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:57,960
So now can we get out of
this creepy pit? You bet.

333
00:17:58,800 --> 00:18:00,540
Nothing's gonna stop us now.

334
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:05,840
Hey! Daylight!

335
00:18:10,780 --> 00:18:12,120
Oh, no, what's that?

336
00:18:16,500 --> 00:18:17,820
Tough luck, guys.

337
00:18:18,020 --> 00:18:20,726
Looks like you're stuck
in that cave for life.

338
00:18:22,540 --> 00:18:24,860
Now we gotta have a little talk.

339
00:18:25,300 --> 00:18:27,020
Talk about what, boss?

340
00:18:27,800 --> 00:18:30,100
Your star chips. Zygo!

341
00:18:30,640 --> 00:18:31,470
Next.

342
00:18:31,553 --> 00:18:33,100
Boss, what's wrong?

343
00:18:33,340 --> 00:18:35,340
What's wrong is that you lost.

344
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:38,460
But boss, I did exactly what you told me.

345
00:18:38,660 --> 00:18:39,660
You lost.

346
00:18:40,120 --> 00:18:41,260
Now hand him over.

347
00:18:41,560 --> 00:18:43,980
Take him, just take him off.

348
00:18:44,080 --> 00:18:45,280
Ten star chips.

349
00:18:45,560 --> 00:18:47,897
Not exactly the way I planned to get him,

350
00:18:47,980 --> 00:18:50,257
but at least now I know
I'll get into the castle.

351
00:18:50,340 --> 00:18:52,360
I hate when he gets like this.

352
00:18:52,460 --> 00:18:53,680
I'm coming, Pegasus.

353
00:18:53,900 --> 00:18:55,540
We got a score to settle.

354
00:18:57,860 --> 00:18:59,272
This thing weighs a ton.

355
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:01,017
We can't even get it to budge.

356
00:19:01,100 --> 00:19:02,380
Push harder, come on!

357
00:19:02,820 --> 00:19:05,060
Are we really trapped in here?
